# Base URL of the NEXUS API. Empty = same origin (local dev uses the Vite
# proxy to http://localhost:8000). On Vercel set it to the API project's URL,
# e.g. https://nexus-api.vercel.app, and add the dashboard's origin to the
# API's CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS. Never put API keys here: users enter them in
# the dashboard and they stay in their browser.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
